---
title: "compute_fork_version (Fulu -- Networking (P2P Interface))"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_fulu: epoch >= FULU_FORK_EPOCH
    [*] --> q_check_electra: epoch < FULU_FORK_EPOCH
    q_check_fulu --> [*]: return FULU_FORK_VERSION
    q_check_electra --> q_return_electra: epoch >= ELECTRA_FORK_EPOCH
    q_check_electra --> q_check_deneb: epoch < ELECTRA_FORK_EPOCH
    q_return_electra --> [*]: return ELECTRA_FORK_VERSION
    q_check_deneb --> q_return_deneb: epoch >= DENEB_FORK_EPOCH
    q_check_deneb --> q_check_capella: epoch < DENEB_FORK_EPOCH
    q_return_deneb --> [*]: return DENEB_FORK_VERSION
    q_check_capella --> q_return_capella: epoch >= CAPELLA_FORK_EPOCH
    q_check_capella --> q_check_bellatrix: epoch < CAPELLA_FORK_EPOCH
    q_return_capella --> [*]: return CAPELLA_FORK_VERSION
    q_check_bellatrix --> q_return_bellatrix: epoch >= BELLATRIX_FORK_EPOCH
    q_check_bellatrix --> q_check_altair: epoch < BELLATRIX_FORK_EPOCH
    q_return_bellatrix --> [*]: return BELLATRIX_FORK_VERSION
    q_check_altair --> q_return_altair: epoch >= ALTAIR_FORK_EPOCH
    q_check_altair --> q_return_genesis: epoch < ALTAIR_FORK_EPOCH
    q_return_altair --> [*]: return ALTAIR_FORK_VERSION
    q_return_genesis --> [*]: return GENESIS_FORK_VERSION
    note right of q_return_genesis
        INV-001: Fork epoch constants are strictly ordered: GENESIS < ALTAIR < BELLATRIX < CAPELLA < DENEB < ELECTRA < FULU
        INV-002: Exactly one branch is taken for any valid epoch value
        INV-003: Function always returns a valid Version
    end note
